  "reasoning": "The defendant used a computer tool (Fiddler) to intercept and manipulate a payment platform, illegally withdrawing money. This constitutes theft (盗窃) of funds via a computer system. Additionally, the defendant taught the method to others, which is covered by the offense of helping others commit computer‑related crimes (帮助信息网络犯罪活动). Therefore the appropriate charges are theft and the crime of assisting information network criminal activity.",
  "final_answer": "[罪名]盗窃;帮助信息网络犯罪活动<eoa>"
